QuestGuidance.Register("en",380,{
[12129]="70046BE1\n1\tSpeak to Duinhir at the Host of the West encampment\030Speak to a scared warrior\030Speak to the uncertain warrior\030Speak to the injured warrior\tDuinhir and soldiers of Gondor can be found at the Host of the West encampment, on the border of North Ithilien and Dagorlad. You should speak to some of those who have expressed concern with marching to the Black Gate.\n2\tSpeak with Aragorn at the Host of the West encampment\tAragorn can be found at the Host of the West encampment, on the border of North Ithilien and Dagorlad. You should speak with Aragorn.\n3\tSpeak with Duinhir\tDuinhir can be found at the Host of the West encampment, on the border of North Ithilien and Dagorlad. You should speak with Duinhir.\n4\tSpeak with Damrod\tDamrod can be found to the north-east of Cair Andros at Caladuil. You should speak to Damrod.\n5\tScout the entrance of Cair Andros\tCair Andros is an island fortress in the Anduin River, bordering North Ithilien and Talath Anor. You should scout the entrance of Cair Andros.\n6\tSpeak with Duinhir near Cair Andros\tDuinhir can be found near Cair Andros. You should speak to Duinhir.\n",
[12130]="7005AFFC\n1\tComplete 'The Fall of Khazad-dûm'\tComplete 'The Fall of Khazad-dûm' on any difficulty. Use the Instance Finder to enter this instance.\n2\tTalk to Dáin at Amdân\tDáin can be found at Amdân. You should talk to Dáin.\n",
[12131]="70059DD4\n1\tSurvive the wrath of Durin's Bane\tKing Náin I has ordered a final stand against the Balrog Durin's Bane. You must attempt to defeat the ancient fiend, and if that fails, survive!\n",
[12132]="70059DDF\n1\tSurvive the wrath of Durin's Bane\tKing Náin I has ordered a final stand against the Balrog Durin's Bane. You must attempt to defeat the ancient fiend, and if that fails, survive!\n",
[12133]="70059DDE\n1\tSurvive the wrath of Durin's Bane\tKing Náin I has ordered a final stand against the Balrog Durin's Bane. You must attempt to defeat the ancient fiend, and if that fails, survive!\n",
[12134]="70059DDC\n1\tSurvive the wrath of Durin's Bane\tKing Náin I has ordered a final stand against the Balrog Durin's Bane. You must attempt to defeat the ancient fiend, and if that fails, survive!\n",
[12135]="70059DDA\n1\tSurvive the wrath of Durin's Bane\tKing Náin I has ordered a final stand against the Balrog Durin's Bane. You must attempt to defeat the ancient fiend, and if that fails, survive!\n",
[12136]="7005D3F7\n1\tTalk to Penfold\tBy completing this quest, you will automatically complete the The Fall of Khazad-dûm, tier 1, tier 2, and tier 3 raid deeds.\n",
[12137]="70016DE8\n1\tTalk to Ráthwald\tRáthwald is by the archway near the camp of Echad Dúnann in Eregion. You have provided much assistance to the dwarves of the expedition, and should now return to Ráthwald to hear the tale of the fall of Moria.\n2\tRáthwald is by the archway near the camp of Echad Dúnann in Eregion. Ráthwald has agreed to tell you the tale of the fall of Moria.\t\n3\tTalk to Ráthwald\tRáthwald is by the archway near the camp of Echad Dúnann in Eregion. Ráthwald has told you the tale of the fall of Moria and is waiting to speak with you.\n",
[12138]="70016DE9\n1\tTalk to Skygni and listen to the tale of the fall of Moria\tSkygni is in the Twenty-first Hall in Moria. Skygni has agreed to tell you the tale of the fall of Moria.\n2\tTalk to Skygni\tSkygni is in the Twenty-first Hall in Moria. Skygni has told you the tale of the fall of Moria and is waiting to speak with you.\n",
[12139]="7000BFC4\n1\tTalk to Elrond\tElrond is at the Last Homely House in Rivendell, in the Trollshaws far to the south of Angmar. You have defeated the Balrog Thaurlach and should inform Elrond Halfelven of your deeds.\n2\tTalk to Glorfindel\030Collect Broken Chain Link\tGlorfindel may be found outside the Last Homely House standing next to the Bruinen. Elrond suggested you speak with Glorfindel about the defeat of Thaurlach, for the tale concerns him greatly.\n",
[12140]="7006351D\n1\tHear Tarandir's tale and complete 'Doom of Caras Gelebren'\tTarandir can be found upon the ruins of an old watch-tower at Caras Gelebren in Swanfleet. You have found a lone Elf in ornate armour standing among the ruins of Caras Gelebren. The Elf, Tarandir, has offered to tell you the tale of the doom of Caras Gelebren. NOTE: To advance this quest, you must complete the Skirmish: Doom of Caras Gelebren. If you have not yet completed the Skirmish Tutorial, you must first visit any Skirmish Camp and speak to the Skirmish Captain. Skirmish Camps can be found throughout Middle-earth in locations such as Bree, Thorin's Gate, Ost Guruth, and Rivendell.\n2\tTalk to Tarandir\tTarandir can be found upon the ruins of an old watch-tower at Caras Gelebren in Swanfleet. You have heard Tarandir's tale of the doom of Caras Gelebren. You should speak to Tarandir.\n3\tListen at the ruins of the House of the Mírdain\030Travel to the ruins of the House of the Mírdain\tThe ruins of the House of the Mírdain can be found at the easternmost point of Caras Gelebren. Tarandir has asked you to stand before the ruins of the House of the Mírdain and listen that you might honour the memory of his people. You should find the ruins of the House of the Mírdain and listen to honour the memory of the Mírdain.\n4\tTalk to Tarandir\tTarandir can be found upon the ruins of an old watch-tower at Caras Gelebren in Swanfleet. You have done as Tarandir asked and listened before the ruins of the House of the Mírdain. You should return to Tarandir.\n",
[12141]="7001B224\n1\tTalk to Saeradan at his cabin\tSaeradan is at his cabin, south of the Old Greenway Fort. Andreg told you to speak with Saeradan regarding the spread of the Orcs from the North Downs.\n",
[12142]="70021E82\n1\tDefeat the maddened elhudan at Oirnad Culch\tA maddened elhudan spirit has claimed Oirnad Culch, south of Gwaed Brun. Tûm has asked you to defeat the wild spirits that have overrun the grove the Derudh once called their own.\n2\tTalk to Tûm at Gwaed Brun\tTûm is at the grove atop Gwaed Brun in the Mournshaws, north of Oirnad Culch. You should return to Tûm with news of your success.\n",
[12143]="70046BD2\n1\tCollect suitable stone (total: 6)\030Collect clean water (total: 4)\tSuitable stone can be found in and around after-battle Osgiliath. Suitable water can be found along the Anduin nearby. You should collect some stone for mending the Statue of the Fallen King and water for washing away the scrawls and filth.\n2\tTalk to Arandol\tYou should talk to Arandol, who can be found at the after-battle Cross-roads.\n3\tClean Gondorian posts (total: 8)\tThe statue is at the after-battle Cross-roads. You should clean the Gondorian posts around the Statue of the Fallen King.\n4\tClean the scrawls and filth from off the statue\tThe statue is at the after-battle Cross-roads. You should clean the Statue of the Fallen King.\n5\tTalk to Arandol\tYou should talk to Arandol, who can be found at the after-battle Cross-roads.\n6\tTalk to Angbor\tYou should talk to Angbor, who can be found at the Cross-roads.\n",
[12144]="70046BB1\n1\tTalk to Arandol\tYou should talk to Arandol, who can be found by the statue at the after-battle Cross-roads.\n2\tThe statue is at the after-battle Cross-roads. You should remove the Orkish poles placed around the Statue of the Fallen King.\t\n3\tBreak the defiled statue head\tThe statue is at the after-battle Cross-roads. You should break the defiled head upon the Statue of the Fallen King.\n4\tRetrieve the statue's original head\tThe statue is at the after-battle Cross-roads. You should retrieve the original head of the Statue of the Fallen King.\n5\tPlace the original head upon the statue\tThe statue is at the after-battle Cross-roads. You should place the original head upon the Statue of the Fallen King.\n6\tTalk to Arandol\tYou should talk to Arandol, who can be found at the after-battle Cross-roads.\n",
[12145]="700556DE\n1\tDefeat the Nine\tDefeat the Nine.\n",
[12146]="700556DD\n1\tDefeat the Nine\tDefeat the Nine.\n",
[12147]="700556DC\n1\tDefeat the Nine\tDefeat the Nine.\n",
[12148]="70071635\n1\tComplete 'Ekal-nêbi, the Fallen Palace' on any difficulty\tMizâdi has requested your help tracking down and defeating Góramul Sai inside the palace. You should complete 'Ekal-nêbi, the Fallen Palace' on any difficulty using the Instance Finder.\n2\tTalk to Mizâdi\tGóramul Sai has been defeated, and Thothril the Entangler has retreated. You should talk to Mizâdi.\n",
[12149]="70042F58\n1\tSearch for the eastern bridge to the Dome of Stars\tThe Dome of Stars can be found in central Osgiliath. Golthor has asked you to seek a Ranger who travelled toward the Dome of Stars. You should begin your search by the eastern bridge onto the island.\n2\tSearch for the lost Ranger inside the Dome of Stars\tThe Ranger is likely somewhere within the Dome of Stars. You did not find the Ranger outside the Dome of Stars, and should now carefully search within it.\n3\tTalk to Golthor\tGolthor can be found outside the old Houses of Healing in north-eastern Osgiliath. You found the Ranger, but it was too late to save him. You should return to Golthor with these grim tidings.\n",
[12150]="7004B2DD\n1\tDefeat Corrupted Soldier (quantity: see journal)\030Defeat Corrupted Archers (total: 3)\030Defeat Corrupted Swordsmen (total: 3)\tCorrupted Gondorian Soliders can be found deep within Anglach: The Great Foundry. You should put these poor souls to rest.\n",
[12151]="7006C6FD\n1\tDefeat servals in their den north-west of Iridír ([see journal]/8)\tRaphûz asked you to assist him in saving a deer from being sacrificed to a serval sire in a den north-west of Iridír. He will meet you near the den where the deer is kept.\n2\tSpeak with Raphûz outside of the serval sire's den\tYou fought your way through the servals. Find Raphûz outside of the den and speak with him.\n3\tDefeat the serval sire, Buzanbûri\tRaphûz is injured and cannot assist with fighting the serval. He asked you to enter the den to defeat the serval and recover the deer.\n4\tRescue the deer and bring it to Raphûz\tThe deer lay before you, injured, but alive. You dealt with the serval. You should lift the fallow deer and deliver it to Raphûz.\n5\tSpeak with Raphûz at Iridír\tYou brought the deer to Raphûz. He bound his wound and said he would take the deer back to Iridír and secure medicine to heal the deer. He asked you to visit him in Iridír.\n",
[12152]="700173C6\n1\tDefeat the Devoted\030Defeat Igash\tIgash and his Devoted are high up in the Grand Stair, north-east of the Orc-watch. Avar has asked you to go forth and defeat Igash and his Devoted.\n2\tTalk to Avar at the Orc-watch\tAvar is at the Orc-watch, south-west of the Grand Stair. You should return to Avar and inform him that you have slain Igash and his Devoted.\n",
[12153]="70047BE4\n1\tDefeat Orcs at Ondoher's Folly (total: 15)\tOrcs can be found throughout Ondoher's Folly in north-western Dagorlad. Laeglaw has asked you to assault the hill of Ondoher's Folly and defeat the Orcs who have claimed it.\n2\tTalk to Laeglaw at Tham Durlan\tLaeglaw can be found due north of Haerondir at Tham Durlan. You have defeated many of the Orcs at Ondoher's Folly and should now return to Laeglaw.\n",
[12154]="70002CCC\n1\tDefeat Iron Crown Captain\tFrith-vailë is in the north-east part of Ram Dúath. Chief Tuokki, hoping to discourage the Orcs and the Angmarim, has asked you to defeat the Captain of the Angmarim in Ram Dúath.\n2\tTalk to Chief Tuokki\tChief Tuokki is at the Suuri-lehmä camp in Ram Dúath. Now that you've defeated the Iron-crown Captain, return to the Earth-kin Chief and tell him of your deed.\n",
[12155]="70036F6B\n1\tTravel to Bywater\tTravel to the Festival Announcer, Caltha Tunnelly, in Bywater to learn more about the annual Farmers Faire! The Hobbits of Bywater are celebrating the summer's bounty with food and drink, fishing, and hunting for eggs and mushrooms in the nearby farm-yards.\n2\tTravel to Bywater in the Shire to participate in the Farmers Faire celebration\tEach year the Hobbits of Bywater celebrate the last of the summer sun and the bounty of the year's harvest by throwing a spectacular Farmers Faire in the middle of town. Visit and join in on the fun!\n",
[12156]="7002FE0A\n1\tDefeat mounted Orcs in the farms of the Norcrofts (total: 10)\tMounted Orcs can be found in the farms of the Norcrofts. Hwitnyd asked you to ride out into the farms of the Norcrofts and defeat the mounted Orcs rampaging through the fields.\n2\tTalk to Hwitnyd\tHwitnyd is at Cliving. Hwitnyd will be pleased to hear that you have driven the Orcs from the farms of the Norcrofts.\n",
[12157]="7002FE0C\n1\tDefeat Warg-riders at the farms of the Sutcrofts (total: 16)\tWarg-riders can be found at the farms of the Sutcrofts. Daggaric asked you to head to the farms of the Sutcrofts and defeat the Warg-riders rampaging through the fields.\n2\tTalk to Daggaric\tDaggaric is at Snowbourn. Daggaric will be pleased to hear that many of the Warg-riders have been driven from the farms of the Sutcrofts.\n",
[12158]="7000F242\n1\tBring the Fashion Maven's scroll to an Outfitter\tBring the Fashion Maven's scroll to an Outfitter to exchange it for the package left for you by the Maven. Outfitters can be found in Celondim, Stock, Trestlebridge, Othrikar, Rivendell, Thorin's Hall, Michel Delving and Bree-town.\n",
[12159]="7000F243\n1\tBring the Fashion Maven's scroll to an Outfitter\tBring the Fashion Maven's scroll to an Outfitter to exchange it for the package left for you by the Maven. Outfitters can be found in Celondim, Stock, Trestlebridge, Othrikar, Rivendell, Thorin's Hall, Michel Delving and Bree-town.\n",
[12160]="7000F244\n1\tBring the Fashion Maven's scroll to an Outfitter\tBring the Fashion Maven's scroll to an Outfitter to exchange it for the package left for you by the Maven. Outfitters can be found in Celondim, Stock, Trestlebridge, Othrikar, Rivendell, Thorin's Hall, Michel Delving and Bree-town.\n",
